Package: etm-powersync-remoteproxyclient
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Provides: libnymea-remoteproxyclient (= ${binary:Version})
Conflicts: libnymea-remoteproxyclient
Replaces: libnymea-remoteproxyclient
Description: ETM-PowerSync remote proxy client library for nymead
 Drop-in replacement of libnymea-remoteproxyclient 1.15.2 (same ABI) used by
 nymead to reach the ETM-PowerSync remote proxy. When a box certificate is
 installed, the library presents it to the proxy on the TCP connection.

Package: etm-powersync-boxcert-check
Architecture: any
Section: utils
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Description: ETM-PowerSync box certificate check
 Says whether a box certificate will be accepted by the ETM-PowerSync remote
 proxy for a given box UUID and serial number, with the rule of the proxy.
 Used by the enrolment of the box.
